note seed/trace/tsha.om: SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4) library unit for tracecli (omega-mv #610). Copied unchanged from
note om/evidence/evidence.om lines 25-239 at b3dca0f1e (functions kinit .. padlen; parity-gated there against
note the C sha256). Units concatenate and there is no import, so the copy is the reuse mechanism (FR-3).
note shainit st / shaupd st p n (n a multiple of 64, at most 4096) / shafin st p n dig, st = 9 ulong cells.
note ---- SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4), tools/zero-legacy/sha256.om with the state in parameters ----
note st 0..7 the hash words, st 8 the bytes absorbed. 32-bit words live in ulong cells, masked
note after every add (4294967295).

fn kinit k edit ulong 64 to void
put k 0 1116352408
put k 1 1899447441
put k 2 3049323471
put k 3 3921009573
put k 4 961987163
put k 5 1508970993
put k 6 2453635748
put k 7 2870763221
put k 8 3624381080
put k 9 310598401
put k 10 607225278
put k 11 1426881987
put k 12 1925078388
put k 13 2162078206
put k 14 2614888103
put k 15 3248222580
put k 16 3835390401
put k 17 4022224774
put k 18 264347078
put k 19 604807628
put k 20 770255983
put k 21 1249150122
put k 22 1555081692
put k 23 1996064986
put k 24 2554220882
put k 25 2821834349
put k 26 2952996808
put k 27 3210313671
put k 28 3336571891
put k 29 3584528711
put k 30 113926993
put k 31 338241895
put k 32 666307205
put k 33 773529912
put k 34 1294757372
put k 35 1396182291
put k 36 1695183700
put k 37 1986661051
put k 38 2177026350
put k 39 2456956037
put k 40 2730485921
put k 41 2820302411
put k 42 3259730800
put k 43 3345764771
put k 44 3516065817
put k 45 3600352804
put k 46 4094571909
put k 47 275423344
put k 48 430227734
put k 49 506948616
put k 50 659060556
put k 51 883997877
put k 52 958139571
put k 53 1322822218
put k 54 1537002063
put k 55 1747873779
put k 56 1955562222
put k 57 2024104815
put k 58 2227730452
put k 59 2361852424
put k 60 2428436474
put k 61 2756734187
put k 62 3204031479
put k 63 3329325298
